---

<BaseLayout
  title="Return to You — Meraki | Greece Group Trip | DestinationGo Travel"
  description="Dawn Owens is leading an exclusive all-women's escorted group trip to Santorini and Paros, September 17-24, 2027. Limited spots available."
  schema={[pageSchema, breadcrumbSchema]}
  ogImage="/images/greece-santorini-aegean-sea.jpg"
>

  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/photoswipe@5/dist/photoswipe.css" />

  <PageHero
    eyebrow="Exclusive Group Trip"
    heading="Greece. Small group. All women. <em>Fully handled.</em>"
    subheading="Dawn is curating an exclusive escorted trip to Greece for a small group of women who want to experience Europe the right way, without doing it alone."
    size="compact"
  />

  <!-- ===================== -->
  <!-- SECTION 1: TRIP INTRO -->
  <!-- ===================== -->
  <section class="trip-intro">
    <div class="trip-intro-inner">

      <!-- Left: text -->
      <div class="trip-intro-left">
        <p class="trip-intro-date">September 17–24, 2027</p>
        <h2 class="trip-intro-heading">Return to You...<br/>Meraki</h2>
        <p class="trip-intro-body">Imagine a place where there is nowhere you need to be, nothing you need to accomplish, and no one you need to take care of but yourself. Where the Aegean's gentle embrace, the warmth of Greek hospitality, and the peaceful beauty of Santorini's legendary Caldera sunsets create space to breathe, reflect, and reconnect with the woman you have always been.</p>
        <div class="trip-intro-cta">
          <a href={BOOK_URL} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn btn--intro-primary">Book Now</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right: two stacked photos -->
      <div class="trip-intro-photos" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="intro-photo intro-photo--top">
          <img src="/images/destinations/greece/IMG_0022.jpeg" alt="Paros harbor village at sunset" />
        </div>
        <div class="intro-photo intro-photo--bottom">
          <img src="/images/destinations/greece/IMG_0007.jpeg" alt="Infinity pool overlooking the Aegean Sea" />
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ========================== -->
  <!-- SECTION 2: PHOTO CAROUSEL  -->
  <!-- ========================== -->
  <section class="carousel-section" aria-label="Greece trip photography">
    <div class="carousel-wrapper">
      <div class="carousel-track pswp-gallery" id="greeceCarousel">
        <div class="carousel-slide"><a href="/images/destinations/greece/IMG_0003.jpeg"><img src="/images/destinations/greece/IMG_0003.jpeg" alt="Whitewashed village with bougainvillea, Santorini" loading="lazy" /></a></div>
        <div class="carousel-slide"><a href="/images/destinations/greece/IMG_0005.jpeg"><img src="/images/destinations/greece/IMG_0005.jpeg" alt="Blue-domed church overlooking the Aegean Sea" loading="lazy" /></a></div>
        <div class="carousel-slide"><a href="/images/destinations/greece/IMG_0008.jpeg"><img src="/images/destinations/greece/IMG_0008.jpeg" alt="Luxury hotel terrace with Aegean views" loading="lazy" /></a></div>
        <div class="carousel-slide"><a href="/images/destinations/greece/IMG_0009.jpeg"><img src="/images/destinations/greece/IMG_0009.jpeg" alt="Caldera sunset from Santorini cliffside" loading="lazy" /></a></div>
        <div class="carousel-slide"><a href="/images/destinations/greece/IMG_0010.jpeg"><img src="/images/destinations/greece/IMG_0010.jpeg" alt="Whitewashed alleyway in Oia, Santorini" loading="lazy" /></a></div>
        <div class="carousel-slide"><a href="/images/destinations/greece/IMG_0011.jpeg"><img src="/images/destinations/greece/IMG_0011.jpeg" alt="Infinity pool overlooking the sea at sunset" loading="lazy" /></a></div>
        <div class="carousel-slide"><a href="/images/destinations/greece/IMG_0014.jpeg"><img src="/images/destinations/greece/IMG_0014.jpeg" alt="Traditional Greek fishing village harbor" loading="lazy" /></a></div>
        <div class="carousel-slide"><a href="/images/destinations/greece/IMG_0015.jpeg"><img src="/images/destinations/greece/IMG_0015.jpeg" alt="Crystal clear Aegean waters at a Paros beach" loading="lazy" /></a></div>
        <div class="carousel-slide"><a href="/images/destinations/greece/IMG_0017.jpeg"><img src="/images/destinations/greece/IMG_0017.jpeg" alt="Outdoor dining at a Greek island taverna" loading="lazy" /></a></div>
        <div class="carousel-slide"><a href="/images/destinations/greece/IMG_0018.jpeg"><img src="/images/destinations/greece/IMG_0018.jpeg" alt="Women cooking class with local Greek recipes" loading="lazy" /></a></div>
        <div class="carousel-slide"><a href="/images/destinations/greece/IMG_0021.jpeg"><img src="/images/destinations/greece/IMG_0021.jpeg" alt="Scenic coastal view from Paros cliffs" loading="lazy" /></a></div>
        <div class="carousel-slide"><a href="/images/destinations/greece/IMG_0024.jpeg"><img src="/images/destinations/greece/IMG_0024.jpeg" alt="Private sunset sailing on the Aegean" loading="lazy" /></a></div>
        <div class="carousel-slide"><a href="/images/destinations/greece/IMG_0026.jpeg"><img src="/images/destinations/greece/IMG_0026.jpeg" alt="Colorful bougainvillea in a Greek island courtyard" loading="lazy" /></a></div>
        <div class="carousel-slide"><a href="/images/destinations/greece/IMG_0027.jpeg"><img src="/images/destinations/greece/IMG_0027.jpeg" alt="Morning light over whitewashed Cycladic architecture" loading="lazy" /></a></div>
        <div class="carousel-slide"><a href="/images/destinations/greece/IMG_0028.jpeg"><img src="/images/destinations/greece/IMG_0028.jpeg" alt="Seaside dinner at a Paros restaurant" loading="lazy" /></a></div>
        <div class="carousel-slide"><a href="/images/destinations/greece/IMG_0029.jpeg"><img src="/images/destinations/greece/IMG_0029.jpeg" alt="Farm-to-table meal in an olive grove" loading="lazy" /></a></div>
      </div>

      <button class="carousel-btn carousel-btn--prev" id="carouselPrev" aria-label="Previous photos">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="15 18 9 12 15 6"/></svg>
      </button>
      <button class="carousel-btn carousel-btn--next" id="carouselNext" aria-label="Next photos">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="9 18 15 12 9 6"/></svg>
      </button>
    </div>

    <div class="carousel-footer">
      <p class="carousel-footer-text">SANTORINI &middot; PAROS &middot; AEGEAN SEA &middot; THE CYCLADES &middot; AND BEYOND</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <script>
    const track = document.getElementById('greeceCarousel');
    document.getElementById('carouselPrev').addEventListener('click', () => {
      track.scrollBy({ left: -420, behavior: 'smooth' });
    });
    document.getElementById('carouselNext').addEventListener('click', () => {
      track.scrollBy({ left: 420, behavior: 'smooth' });
    });
  </script>

  <script type="module">
    import PhotoSwipeLightbox from 'https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/photoswipe@5/dist/photoswipe-lightbox.esm.js';

    function setDimensions(galleryEl) {
      galleryEl.querySelectorAll('a').forEach(link => {
        const img = link.querySelector('img');
        if (!img) return;
        const apply = () => {
          if (img.naturalWidth) {
            link.dataset.pswpWidth = img.naturalWidth;
            link.dataset.pswpHeight = img.naturalHeight;
          }
        };
        if (img.complete) apply();
        else img.addEventListener('load', apply, { once: true });
      });
    }

    document.querySelectorAll('.pswp-gallery').forEach(galleryEl => {
      setDimensions(galleryEl);
      const lightbox = new PhotoSwipeLightbox({
        gallery: galleryEl,
        children: 'a',
        pswpModule: () => import('https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/photoswipe@5/dist/photoswipe.esm.js'),
      });
      lightbox.init();
    });
  </script>

  <!-- ============================ -->
  <!-- SECTION 3: EXPERIENCE NARRATIVE -->
  <!-- ============================ -->
  <section class="experience-narrative">
    <div class="container experience-inner">
      <p class="eyebrow eyebrow--teal">The Experience</p>
      <div class="hairline hairline--left"></div>
      <h2 class="experience-heading">Two extraordinary destinations. One unforgettable week.</h2>

      <p class="experience-lead">Your Greek island retreat unfolds across two carefully chosen destinations, each selected for its unique character, beauty, and ability to help you slow down and savor the moment.</p>

      <div class="destination-blocks">
        <div class="destination-block">
          <div class="destination-label">Santorini</div>
          <h3 class="destination-name">Secret View Hotel</h3>
          <p>You will spend three unforgettable nights at Secret View Hotel, an elegant boutique retreat overlooking the sparkling Aegean Sea. Away from the crowds yet perfectly positioned to enjoy the island's iconic beauty, Secret View offers the ideal setting to unwind, connect, and witness the peaceful magic of Santorini's famous Caldera sunsets.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="destination-divider" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="destination-block">
          <div class="destination-label">Paros</div>
          <h3 class="destination-name">Vione Paros</h3>
          <p>Your journey continues in Paros, where you will settle into the luxurious Vione Paros. With panoramic sea views, sophisticated accommodations, and a relaxed atmosphere just moments from the charming village of Naoussa, Vione provides the perfect backdrop for the slower pace that defines island life in the Cyclades.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="activities-narrative">
        <p>Throughout the week, you will experience Greece through thoughtfully curated activities designed to immerse you in the culture, cuisine, and beauty of the islands. Sail aboard a private sunset catamaran through Santorini's stunning caldera, discover traditional villages and authentic local flavors, enjoy a farm-to-table culinary experience, participate in a hands-on Greek cooking class, and spend a blissful day soaking up the sunshine at one of Paros' most beautiful beach clubs.</p>
        <p>Between experiences, you will have plenty of time to wander picturesque alleyways lined with whitewashed buildings and vibrant bougainvillea, linger over leisurely meals, browse local shops, relax by the pool, or simply sit quietly and watch the rhythm of island life unfold around you.</p>
        <p>This is not a sightseeing marathon or a packed tour schedule. Every detail has been intentionally designed to create the perfect balance between meaningful experiences and the freedom to simply be present.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="experience-cta">
        <p class="experience-urgency">This is an intimate and highly personalized experience. See the booking page for current availability.</p>
        <a href={BOOK_URL} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn btn--primary-teal">Book Now</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ========================== -->
  <!-- SECTION 4: SECOND PHOTO GRID -->
  <!-- ========================== -->
  <section class="photo-grid-section" aria-label="More Greece photography">
    <div class="photo-grid-wrap">
      <div class="photo-grid pswp-gallery">
        <div class="photo-cell"><a href="/images/destinations/greece/IMG_0025.jpeg"><img src="/images/destinations/greece/IMG_0025.jpeg" alt="Outdoor dining at a traditional Greek taverna" loading="lazy" /></a></div>
        <div class="photo-cell"><a href="/images/destinations/greece/IMG_0031.jpeg"><img src="/images/destinations/greece/IMG_0031.jpeg" alt="Women gathering at a Greek cooking class" loading="lazy" /></a></div>
        <div class="photo-cell"><a href="/images/destinations/greece/IMG_0038.jpeg"><img src="/images/destinations/greece/IMG_0038.jpeg" alt="Scenic Greek village alleyway with blue doors" loading="lazy" /></a></div>
        <div class="photo-cell"><a href="/images/destinations/greece/IMG_0042.jpeg"><img src="/images/destinations/greece/IMG_0042.jpeg" alt="Sunset over the Aegean Sea from a terrace" loading="lazy" /></a></div>
        <div class="photo-cell"><a href="/images/destinations/greece/IMG_0043.jpeg"><img src="/images/destinations/greece/IMG_0043.jpeg" alt="Luxury hotel pool in Paros, Greece" loading="lazy" /></a></div>
        <div class="photo-cell"><a href="/images/destinations/greece/IMG_0044.jpeg"><img src="/images/destinations/greece/IMG_0044.jpeg" alt="Woman walking along a Paros harbor jetty" loading="lazy" /></a></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ================================= -->
  <!-- SECTION 5: INCLUDED / NOT INCLUDED -->
  <!-- ================================= -->
  <section class="inclusions-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="inclusions-grid">

        <div class="inclusions-col inclusions-col--yes">
          <h2 class="inclusions-heading">What's Included</h2>
          <ul class="inclusions-list">
            {included.map(item => (
              <li>
                <svg class="inc-icon inc-icon--yes" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
                {item}
              </li>
            ))}
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="inclusions-col inclusions-col--no">
          <h2 class="inclusions-heading">What's Not Included</h2>
          <ul class="inclusions-list inclusions-list--no">
            {notIncluded.map(item => (
              <li>
                <svg class="inc-icon inc-icon--no" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><line x1="18" y1="6" x2="6" y2="18"/><line x1="6" y1="6" x2="18" y2="18"/></svg>
                {item}
              </li>
            ))}
          </ul>
        </div>

      </div>

      <div class="inclusions-cta">
        <a href={BOOK_URL} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn btn--primary-teal">Book Now</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ====================== -->
  <!-- SECTION 6: PRICING -->
  <!-- ====================== -->
  <section class="pricing-section">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow eyebrow--teal" style="text-align:center;">Investment</p>
      <div class="hairline hairline--center"></div>
      <h2 class="pricing-heading">Pricing Details</h2>
      <p class="pricing-subhead">Choose the experience that fits you best. All packages include every included item listed above.</p>

      <div class="pricing-grid">
        {pricingPackages.map(pkg => (
          <div class={`pricing-card ${pkg.badge ? 'pricing-card--featured' : ''}`}>
            {pkg.badge && <div class="pricing-badge">{pkg.badge}</div>}
            <div class="pricing-card-header">
              <div class="pricing-card-name">{pkg.name}</div>
              <div class="pricing-card-subtitle">{pkg.subtitle}</div>
              <div class="pricing-card-price">{pkg.price}<span class="pricing-per"> / person</span></div>
            </div>
            <div class="pricing-card-body">
              <div class="pricing-hotels">
                <div class="pricing-hotel-row">
                  <span class="pricing-hotel-island">Santorini</span>
                  <span class="pricing-hotel-name">{pkg.santorini}</span>
                </div>
                <div class="pricing-hotel-row">
                  <span class="pricing-hotel-island">Paros</span>
                  <span class="pricing-hotel-name">{pkg.paros}</span>
                </div>
              </div>
              <p class="pricing-bedding"><strong>Bedding:</strong> {pkg.bedding}</p>
              <div class="pricing-schedule">
                <div class="pricing-schedule-label">Payment Schedule</div>
                <div class="pricing-schedule-row pricing-schedule-row--deposit">
                  <span>{pkg.deposit}</span>
                  <span>Deposit at time of booking</span>
                </div>
                {pkg.payments.map(p => (
                  <div class="pricing-schedule-row">
                    <span>{p.amount}</span>
                    <span>{p.due}</span>
                  </div>
                ))}
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>

      <div class="pricing-notes">
        <p>Need a roommate? We are happy to assist with roommate matching based on availability. While we cannot guarantee a match, we will make every reasonable effort to pair you with another guest seeking shared accommodations.</p>
        <p>Registration deadline: July 15, 2026. Payment plans available upon request. All payments are non-refundable. Airfare and travel insurance are not included. Non-refundable travel insurance is required at time of booking. See booking page for current availability.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="pricing-cta">
        <a href={BOOK_URL} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn btn--primary-teal">Book Now</a>
        <a href="/terms" class="btn btn--outline-teal">Terms &amp; Conditions</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ========================= -->
  <!-- SECTION 7: ABOUT HOSTESS -->
  <!-- ========================= -->
  <section class="hostess-section">
    <div class="hostess-card-wrap pswp-gallery">
      <a href="/images/dawn-owens.webp" class="hostess-img-link">
        <img
          src="/images/dawn-owens.webp"
          alt="Dawn Owens, founder of DestinationGo Travel"
          class="hostess-photo"
          loading="lazy"
        />
      </a>
      <p class="hostess-name">Dawn Owens</p>
      <p class="hostess-title">Luxury Travel Advisor &amp; Trip Host</p>
    </div>

    <div class="hostess-bio">
      <p class="eyebrow eyebrow--teal" style="text-align:center;">Kalosórisma (Καλωσόρισμα)</p>
      <div class="hairline hairline--center"></div>
      <h2 class="hostess-heading">Get to Know Your Hostess</h2>

      <p class="hostess-welcome"><strong>Welcome, my friend.</strong></p>
      <p>A few years ago, if you had asked me what I needed most, the answer would have been simple: more time. More time to think. More time to breathe. More time to remember who I was outside of my responsibilities.</p>
      <p>Like so many women, I spent years taking care of everyone else first. Building a career. Raising a family. Managing schedules, obligations, and the endless list of things that needed my attention. Somewhere along the way, I realized that while I was helping everyone else create memories, I was not giving myself enough space to create my own.</p>

      <div class="hostess-expanded" id="hostessExpanded" hidden>
        <p>That is why I created this experience.</p>
        <p>This is not a trip designed to check destinations off a list. It is not a race to see everything Greece has to offer. Greece deserves more than that, and so do you.</p>
        <p>This journey is about embracing the slower rhythm of the Greek islands. It is about lingering over conversations, watching sunsets without looking at your phone, wandering through whitewashed villages with nowhere particular to be, and remembering what it feels like to wake up each day without a long list of obligations waiting for you.</p>
        <p>The Greeks have a beautiful way of approaching life. They understand that connection matters. Community matters. Rest matters. Joy matters.</p>
        <p>Over this trip, my hope is that you will give yourself permission to step away from the noise and reconnect with the woman you have been taking care of last.</p>
        <p>Whether you come with a friend, your mother, your sister, or entirely on your own, I hope you leave with new friendships, renewed confidence, unforgettable memories, and a deeper connection to yourself.</p>
        <p>This experience is called <em>Return to You — Meraki</em> for a reason. Meraki means doing something with your soul, creativity, and love. Every detail of this journey has been designed with exactly that intention.</p>
        <p>I would be honored to share Greece with you.</p>
        <p class="hostess-closing">
          Let's slow down together.<br />
          Let's reconnect together.<br />
          <strong>Let's return to you.</strong>
        </p>
        <p class="hostess-signature">— Dawn Owens, DestinationGo Travel</p>
      </div>

      <button class="hostess-toggle" id="hostessToggle" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="hostessExpanded">
        Read more
      </button>
    </div>
  </section>

  <script>
